@juggernaut: i thought if a minion used the maneuver from a gun, it also had to strike with that gun, no? so, how could you play form of mist instead of the mandatory zipgun-strike, or did i misread you somehow? -thank you for enlightening me.

i found a section in the rulebook saying:
'If a minion uses the maneuver from a strike card or a weapon, he is effectively choosing his strike as well. As such, he cannot use a second strike card or weapon to maneuver again in the same round.'...
